(εἴσωθεν only in {{Refs 5th c.BC+|5th c.BC: Hippocrates Medicus “περὶ ἄρθρων ἐμβολῆς” 46 codices)}}, rarely **ἔσωθε** {{Refs 5th c.BC+|5th c.BC: Euripides Tragicus “Heraclidae” 42}}: _adverb_: **from within,** {{Refs 5th c.BC+|5th c.BC: Herodotus Historicus 7.36, 8.37, 4th c.BC: Aeneas Tacticus 32.7, etc.}}
